# Keeps secrets, history and heavy folders out of the build context and so out of the images (PLAN.md 15.4)
.git
.github
.husky
.turbo
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets and private data
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
keystore.properties
.secrets
backups
premium
content-private

# Not part of any server image
# pnpm checks the lockfile against every workspace, so the manifest of the app stays
apps/mobile/*
!apps/mobile/package.json
kot-gambit-design
docs
PLAN.md
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
**/*.md
!**/README.md
